                1
            ],
            "user id": "OneJKMolina",
            "tweet id": "1512807049410887688",
            "content": "i 've passed 5k dozens of times for my clients and myself . and these are the 5 things you need the most : 1 . bio optimization 2 . threads 3 . consistent tweets 4 . proving competence 5 . giving bigger accounts a reason to care here 's how you do each :",
            "time": "22-04-09 14:58",
            "timestamp": 1649487481
        },
        {
            "comment id": 1,
            "parent": 0,
            "children": [
                2
            ],
            "user id": "OneJKMolina",
            "tweet id": "1512807051289845761",
            "content": "1 . your bio should answer 3 questions a ) what have you built / done ? b ) what are you building ? c ) why should people follow you ? when people land in your page you want to let them know exactly how you can help them .",
            "time": "22-04-09 14:58",
            "timestamp": 1649487482
        },
        {
            "comment id": 2,
            "parent": 1,
            "children": [
                3
            ],
            "user id": "OneJKMolina",
            "tweet id": "1512807053261262848",
            "content": "2 . threads twitter is n't a game of consistent hits . it 's a game of sporadic home runs your growth wo n't come from tweets adding up . they 'll come from a few viral threads that make you grow fast and that 's good . it means that even if you 're stuck you 're always 1 thread away",
            "time": "22-04-09 14:58",
            "timestamp": 1649487482
        },
        {
            "comment id": 3,
            "parent": 2,
            "children": [],
            "user id": "OneJKMolina",
            "tweet id": "1512807055190540297",
            "content": "i recommend 2-3 x threads a week about one topic . it 's counterintuitive , but the less topics you talk about the more you grow . niche topics -> higher interest people -> they more likely they 're to share your content you can rebrand later if you want to . i 've done it 8 times .",
            "time": "22-04-09 14:58",
